# qmldir — explicit module manifest for modules/dashboard/ (Phase 14 Plan 03)
#
# Checking this file in disables Quickshell's directory-scanner synthesis for
# this directory (same finding as the parent modules/qmldir header) — any
# .qml type added to this directory that is NOT declared below becomes
# unresolvable to Dashboard.qml's `import "dashboard"`. A type MUST be
# registered in the SAME commit that creates it.
#
# This manifest is owned by plan 14-03 and frozen for wave 3 (14-04..14-07):
# a wave-3 plan needing an unlisted type here has found a 14-03 scope
# correction, not a licence to edit this file. Nine types, none a singleton
# — the two shell-root backends and the shared resource reader are mounted
# once as ordinary instances by 14-03 (shell.qml / Dashboard.qml), which
# keeps their lifetime explicit rather than ambient.
module qs.modules.dashboard
DashboardTab 1.0 DashboardTab.qml
MediaTab 1.0 MediaTab.qml
PerformanceTab 1.0 PerformanceTab.qml
WeatherTab 1.0 WeatherTab.qml
MediaBackend 1.0 MediaBackend.qml
WeatherBackend 1.0 WeatherBackend.qml
SystemResources 1.0 SystemResources.qml
QuickToggles 1.0 QuickToggles.qml
Dial 1.0 Dial.qml
